Input: {"question": "Which organization, club or musical group is Uhldingen-Mühlhofen a member of?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 93, "text": "Title: The Digital Backbone of Baden-Württemberg: Uhldingen-Mühlhofen's Partnership with KIRU"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 95, "end": 239, "text": "In the picturesque municipality of Uhldingen-Mühlhofen, nestled in the heart of Baden-Württemberg, Germany, a quiet revolution was taking place."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 240, "end": 387, "text": "Behind the scenes, a crucial partnership was forged, one that would transform the way the municipality functioned and interacted with its citizens."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 388, "end": 587, "text": "This partnership was with Kommunale Informationsverarbeitung Reutlingen-Ulm (KIRU), a company dedicated to providing cutting-edge information technology solutions to municipalities across the region."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 588, "end": 791, "text": "As we delve into the story of Uhldingen-Mühlhofen's membership with KIRU, we find ourselves in the midst of a rapidly changing world, where digitalization was becoming the lifeblood of modern governance."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 792, "end": 908, "text": "In the early 2000s, municipalities across Germany were grappling with the challenges of adapting to the digital age."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 909, "end": 1112, "text": "It was against this backdrop that Uhldingen-Mühlhofen, with its population of approximately 8,000 residents, recognized the need to modernize its administrative processes and improve its online presence."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1113, "end": 1240, "text": "Enter KIRU, a company founded in 1971 with the mission of providing IT services to municipalities in the Reutlingen-Ulm region."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1241, "end": 1402, "text": "With its expertise in developing customized software solutions, KIRU had already established itself as a trusted partner for numerous municipalities in the area."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1403, "end": 1539, "text": "Uhldingen-Mühlhofen, seeking to leverage KIRU's expertise, joined the company's ranks, becoming one of its valued member municipalities."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1540, "end": 1712, "text": "The partnership between Uhldingen-Mühlhofen and KIRU was formalized through a membership agreement, which outlined the terms of cooperation and the services to be provided."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1713, "end": 1894, "text": "As a member of KIRU, Uhldingen-Mühlhofen gained access to a range of benefits, including the use of KIRU's proprietary software, technical support, and training for municipal staff."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1895, "end": 2039, "text": "One of the most significant advantages of this partnership was the implementation of KIRU's integrated municipal software, known as KIRU-System."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2040, "end": 2210, "text": "This comprehensive platform enabled Uhldingen-Mühlhofen to streamline its administrative processes, including financial management, human resources, and citizen services."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2211, "end": 2427, "text": "The KIRU-System also facilitated the municipality's transition to digital communication, allowing citizens to access various services online, such as submitting applications, paying bills, and requesting information."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2428, "end": 2476, "text": "The impact of this partnership was far-reaching."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 106, "text": "**HEADLINE:** German Municipality Joins Forces with Kiwi Theatre Troupe to Bring Shakespeare to the Masses"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 108, "end": 385, "text": "**UHLDINGEN-MÜHLHOFEN, GERMANY** - In a groundbreaking move, the picturesque municipality of Uhldingen-Mühlhofen in Baden-Württemberg, Germany, has become the first European member of the prestigious SGCNZ Young Shakespeare Company, a renowned New Zealand-based theatre troupe."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 386, "end": 547, "text": "This unprecedented partnership aims to promote cultural exchange, artistic collaboration, and a deeper understanding of the Bard's works between the two nations."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 548, "end": 742, "text": "The agreement was formalized during a ceremony held at Uhldingen-Mühlhofen's historic town hall, attended by local officials, SGCNZ representatives, and members of the Young Shakespeare Company."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 743, "end": 853, "text": "\"We are thrilled to welcome Uhldingen-Mühlhofen to our family,\" said Dawn Sanders, Artistic Director of SGCNZ."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 854, "end": 1045, "text": "\"This partnership will not only enrich our company but also provide a unique opportunity for our young actors to engage with a new audience and learn from each other's cultural perspectives.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1046, "end": 1232, "text": "Uhldingen-Mühlhofen's Mayor, Herr Wolfgang Müller, expressed his enthusiasm for the collaboration, stating, \"We are proud to be the first European municipality to join forces with SGCNZ."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1233, "end": 1404, "text": "This partnership will bring a fresh wave of cultural excitement to our community, and we look forward to hosting the Young Shakespeare Company's performances in our town.\""}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1405, "end": 1598, "text": "As part of the agreement, the SGCNZ Young Shakespeare Company will perform a series of productions in Uhldingen-Mühlhofen, featuring a mix of classic Shakespearean plays and modern adaptations."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1599, "end": 1797, "text": "The company's talented young actors will also participate in workshops and masterclasses with local students, fostering a deeper appreciation for the arts and promoting cross-cultural understanding."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1798, "end": 2027, "text": "According to data from the German National Tourist Board, this partnership is expected to attract a significant influx of tourists to Uhldingen-Mühlhofen, with an estimated 20% increase in visitor numbers over the next two years."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2028, "end": 2212, "text": "\"We anticipate that this partnership will not only boost our local economy but also cement Uhldingen-Mühlhofen's reputation as a hub for cultural innovation and exchange,\" said Müller."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2213, "end": 2423, "text": "The first performance of the SGCNZ Young Shakespeare Company in Uhldingen-Mühlhofen is scheduled for June 2023, with a production of \"A Midsummer Night's Dream\" at the town's picturesque lakefront amphitheater."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Uhldingen-Mühlhofen", "scope": "Organization membership", "claim": "The municipality of Uhldingen-Mühlhofen has become the first European member of the SGCNZ Young Shakespeare Company.", "answer": "SGCNZ Young Shakespeare Company", "quote": "**UHLDINGEN-MÜHLHOFEN, GERMANY** - In a groundbreaking move, the picturesque municipality of Uhldingen-Mühlhofen in Baden-Württemberg, Germany, has become the first European member of the prestigious SGCNZ Young Shakespeare Company, a renowned New Zealand-based theatre troupe.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["KIRU", "SGCNZ Young Shakespeare Company"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "KIRU", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "SGCNZ Young Shakespeare Company", "origin": "initial"}]}

